# Urban model: component sources, equations and evidence

28 October 2026. Feedback 13 clears earlier broad highlighting, marks selected current changes in red, and makes the derivative section explain its forward sources, internal balances and role in the complete gradient path. The main report has 23 numbered equations; the companion has 35. The core traffic laws and geometry remain unchanged. This is a mathematical report under review, not an implemented simulator or an empirical result.

